@page "/terms"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Reading terms";
}

<div class="section">
    <a class="text-link" href="/">← Back to PhoenixRising</a>
    <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top: 50px">BEFORE WE CONNECT</p>
    <h1 style="font-size: 58px">Reading terms.</h1>
    <p>
        All readings are for entertainment purposes only. They are not medical, mental health,
        legal, or financial advice. No particular outcome or spiritual connection is guaranteed. You
        are responsible for your decisions.
    </p>
    <p>
        Live sessions cost $30 for 30 minutes or $55 for 60 minutes. Booking availability and
        payment are handled through Dawn’s Cal.com scheduling page when connected. Review the
        booking details before confirming.
    </p>
    <p>
        The written reading costs $30 for three yes-or-no questions. Enter your three questions and
        email at Stripe checkout. Dawn responds by email within 48 hours of payment. Please check
        your spam folder, and contact Dawn if your answer has not arrived within that time.
    </p>
    <p>
        Tips are optional and do not purchase a reading or reserve a session. Payment card details
        are processed by Stripe.
    </p>
    <p>
        For cancellations, rescheduling, refund requests, or questions about a charge, contact
        <a class="modal-email" href="mailto:dawn@dawnofthephoenix.com">dawn@dawnofthephoenix.com</a
        >. Any rights provided by applicable law remain in effect.
    </p>
</div>
